
== A system wayfinder ==

The `way` command should show you services you've installed on the system as
opposed to what's there by default. It should also show the status of those
services and their relation to other services.

Autodiscovery would be nice, but may be impossible.

Would be cute to make an ascii map.

Waycrumbs?
wayf - niice name

`way solve` - find solutions?


